{"seq":3,"slug":"state-backend-selection-migration-recovery","title":"状态后端选型、状态迁移与故障恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/streaming-sql-materialized-view-engine-flink/state-backend-fault-tolerance/state-backend-selection-migration-recovery","wordCount":2545,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"状态后端选型-状态迁移与故障恢复\">状态后端选型、状态迁移与故障恢复</h1><p>一个跑跨境订单去重的 Flink SQL 作业，上线时状态只有 3 GB，选什么都无所谓；八个月后 keyed 状态长到 900 GB，TaskManager 开始被 OOM Killer 杀掉，重启后又要花 40 分钟加载状态——这时选型才真正开始收钱。状态后端决定三件事：状态放在哪里、快照怎么打、故障后多快能回来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-状态后端是-本地形态-与-快照形态-的组合\">核心概念：状态后端是「本地形态」与「快照形态」的组合</h2><p>Flink 的 state backend 是两个正交决策的打包：<strong>本地状态怎么存</strong>（供算子读写）和 <strong>checkpoint 落到哪里</strong>（供容错恢复）。Flink 1.13 之后这两件事被拆成两个配置——<code>state.backend.type</code> 管本地形态，<code>execution.checkpointing.storage</code> 管快照落点（<code>jobmanager</code>，或 <code>filesystem</code> + <code>execution.checkpointing.dir</code>）。旧的三个类名 <code>MemoryStateBackend</code> / <code>FsStateBackend</code> / <code>RocksDBStateBackend</code> 已被映射到新组合（Flink 1.20 文档 <em>State Backends</em>）。这层拆分解释了为什么「换后端」没那么可怕：只要快照落点在文件系统，本地换成什么只是算子的读写路径变了，持久层的字节还是那些字节。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  JOB[作业运行: 算子读写本地状态] --&gt; LOCAL{本地形态}&#10;  LOCAL --&gt;|hashmap| HEAP[堆内 Java 对象&lt;br/&gt;快, 受 JVM 堆限制]&#10;  LOCAL --&gt;|rocksdb| LSM[本地 RocksDB LSM&lt;br/&gt;序列化字节, 受磁盘限制]&#10;  LOCAL --&gt;|forst| RMT[远程 SST + 本地缓存&lt;br/&gt;实验性]&#10;  HEAP --&gt; SNAP[快照]&#10;  LSM --&gt; SNAP&#10;  RMT --&gt; SNAP&#10;  SNAP --&gt;|全量或增量| CP[(checkpoint 目录&lt;br/&gt;HDFS / S3)]&#10;  CP --&gt;|故障: 取最近完成快照 + 重放 offset| JOB\">graph TD\n  JOB[作业运行: 算子读写本地状态] --&gt; LOCAL{本地形态}\n  LOCAL --&gt;|hashmap| HEAP[堆内 Java 对象&lt;br/&gt;快, 受 JVM 堆限制]\n  LOCAL --&gt;|rocksdb| LSM[本地 RocksDB LSM&lt;br/&gt;序列化字节, 受磁盘限制]\n  LOCAL --&gt;|forst| RMT[远程 SST + 本地缓存&lt;br/&gt;实验性]\n  HEAP --&gt; SNAP[快照]\n  LSM --&gt; SNAP\n  RMT --&gt; SNAP\n  SNAP --&gt;|全量或增量| CP[(checkpoint 目录&lt;br/&gt;HDFS / S3)]\n  CP --&gt;|故障: 取最近完成快照 + 重放 offset| JOB</pre><p>本质差异只有一句话：<strong>hashmap 把状态当对象存，rocksdb 把状态当字节存，forst 把字节存到远端</strong>。对象访问快但没有序列化边界；字节访问慢一个数量级但可超出内存；远端访问把磁盘容量也解耦掉，代价是每次读可能走网络。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>后端</th>\n<th><code>state.backend.type</code></th>\n<th>本地存储</th>\n<th>增量快照</th>\n<th>容量上限</th>\n<th>相对速度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HashMapStateBackend</td>\n<td><code>hashmap</code>（默认）</td>\n<td>JVM 堆对象</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>堆内存</td>\n<td>最快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EmbeddedRocksDBStateBackend</td>\n<td><code>rocksdb</code></td>\n<td>本地 RocksDB SST</td>\n<td><strong>支持</strong>（需显式开启）</td>\n<td>本地磁盘</td>\n<td>慢约一个数量级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ForStStateBackend</td>\n<td><code>forst</code>（实验性）</td>\n<td>远端 SST 为主</td>\n<td>始终增量（无 canonical savepoint）</td>\n<td>远端存储</td>\n<td>受网络往返影响</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"选型-先估算状态规模-再决定要不要过序列化边界\">选型：先估算状态规模，再决定要不要过序列化边界</h2><p>选型的唯一硬门槛是<strong>状态能不能装进内存</strong>。HashMap 把每个 key 的状态做成堆内对象，一次 <code>get</code> 就是一次指针跳转，吞吐最高；但容量上限等于堆，而堆里还住着算子代码、反序列化缓冲和 JVM 开销，真实可用往往只有堆的 60% 上下。RocksDB 把状态写成序列化字节，每次访问都要反序列化、可能触发磁盘读，官方描述为比堆后端「慢约一个数量级」，换来容量只受本地磁盘约束，并且是内置后端里<strong>唯一支持增量快照</strong>的（Flink 2.0 文档 <em>State Backends</em>）。</p>\n<p>跨境电商的状态规模可以估：去重表按「大促期间下单用户数」估 key 数，聚合表按「国家 × 渠道 × SKU 维度基数」估 key 数，join 缓冲按「汇率/关税规则维表行数 × 副本」估。粗略体积是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>state</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>keys</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>key</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>value</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>overhead</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{state}} \\approx N_{\\text{keys}} \\times (b_{\\text{key}} + b_{\\text{value}} + b_{\\text{overhead}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">state</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">keys</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">key</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">value</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overhead</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。HashMap 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>overhead</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_{\\text{overhead}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">overhead</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是对象头与引用（每项 40–80 字节量级），RocksDB 则叠加 LSM 写放大与 compaction 临时空间，实际占用通常是逻辑大小的 1.5–3 倍。经验判据：单 TM 状态稳定超过堆的 50%，或单作业状态超过 100 GB，就该走 RocksDB。</p>\n<p>RocksDB 的内存不是自动无限的：Flink 默认开启托管内存（<code>state.backend.rocksdb.memory.managed</code>），按 slot 预算给 block cache 与 MemTable 分配，写缓冲占比默认 <code>state.backend.rocksdb.memory.write-buffer-ratio: 0.5</code>，索引/布隆过滤器独占池占比默认 <code>state.backend.rocksdb.memory.high-prio-pool-ratio: 0.1</code>（官方不建议把后者设为 0，否则过滤器会与数据块抢内存）。调优的第一手段永远是<strong>加大 managed memory</strong>——默认 fraction 0.4 偏保守（Flink 2.0 文档 <em>Tuning Checkpoints and Large State</em>）。</p>\n<p>RocksDB 还有两个坑。其一，key 与 value 各自上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>31</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{31}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">31</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 字节（受 JNI 限制），而 <code>ListState</code> 这类基于 merge 的状态会<strong>静默突破</strong>这个上限，直到读取时才失败。其二，定时器默认也存 RocksDB（<code>state.backend.rocksdb.timer-service.factory: rocksdb</code>），切成 <code>heap</code> 能提速，但会<strong>失去定时器状态的异步快照</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态迁移-savepoint-是-operator-uid-到状态的映射\">状态迁移：savepoint 是 operator UID 到状态的映射</h2><p>作业改代码、改并行度、换后端、拆算子，都要靠 savepoint。它的结构可以理解成一张表：<strong>每个有状态的算子 UID 是一行，值是该算子的状态</strong>。这决定了迁移的第一条铁律——<strong>给每个算子显式 <code>uid()</code></strong>。不设 UID 时 Flink 从作业拓扑推导哈希 ID，代码一改拓扑就变，恢复时找不到对应行，直接失败；文档建议给所有算子都设 UID，因为一些内置算子会以不明显的方式持有状态。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>跨后端可移植</th>\n<th>跨版本稳定</th>\n<th>生成/恢复速度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>canonical（默认）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>较慢</td>\n<td>换后端、升级版本、长期归档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>native（Flink 1.15+）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>较快</td>\n<td>仅同后端同版本的重启</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>换后端只能用 canonical。</strong> canonical 自 Flink 1.13 起统一，之后打的 savepoint 可换任意 state backend 恢复；native 绑定产出它的后端（例如 RocksDB 的 SST 文件），换后端就恢复不了。所以「hashmap 迁 rocksdb」的路径是：canonical savepoint 停作业 → 改 <code>state.backend.type: rocksdb</code> → 从 savepoint 恢复；反向同理，但要先确认状态能装进堆。</p>\n<p>改并行度是 savepoint 最成熟的能力：恢复时指定新并行度，Flink 按 key group 重新分配 keyed 状态。前置条件是 <strong>key group 数量由最大并行度 <code>maxParallelism</code> 决定，且一旦定下就不能改</strong>（除非用 State Processor API 重建）；默认 128，若预期未来要扩到更大，必须在首次上线时就调高。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"bin/flink stop --type canonical --savepointPath hdfs:///flink/savepoints :jobId&#10;bin/flink savepoint --type canonical :jobId hdfs:///flink/savepoints -detached&#10;bin/flink run -s hdfs:///flink/savepoints/savepoint-xxxx -claimMode CLAIM :jobId&#10;bin/flink run -s hdfs:///flink/savepoints/savepoint-xxxx -n   # 忽略已删除算子的状态\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bin/flink</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stop</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> canonical</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --savepointPath</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hdfs:///flink/savepoints</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> :jobId</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bin/flink</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> savepoint</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --type</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> canonical</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> :jobId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hdfs:///flink/savepoints</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -detached</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bin/flink</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hdfs:///flink/savepoints/savepoint-xxxx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -claimMode</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> CLAIM</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> :jobId</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bin/flink</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hdfs:///flink/savepoints/savepoint-xxxx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 忽略已删除算子的状态</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>-n</code> 用于「删掉了某个有状态算子」的情况，不加会直接恢复失败；新增的有状态算子则从空状态开始。<code>claimMode</code> 决定快照文件所有权：<code>NO_CLAIM</code>（默认）下 Flink 不删原文件、会先强制跑一次全量 checkpoint；<code>CLAIM</code> 下 Flink 接管文件、可自动清理，但不能让两个作业共享同一份 savepoint（Flink 2.0 起 <code>LEGACY</code> 被移除）。</p>\n<p>超出「换并行度 / 换后端」的迁移——改状态数据类型、拆分或合并算子状态、给老作业补历史初始化状态——用 <strong>State Processor API</strong>。它把 savepoint 当数据库：每个算子是一个 namespace，其所有 keyed state 共享一张表，键列加每个状态一列。<code>SavepointReader.read(...)</code> 读出，用 <code>BATCH</code> 模式 DataStream 转换，再用 <code>SavepointWriter</code> 写回并指定新的最大并行度。典型用途：批数据 bootstrap 初始状态、审计状态是否被写脏、把状态平滑搬到另一个 UID 下（<code>changeOperatorIdentifier</code>）。要求 <code>flink-state-processor-api</code> 依赖，且状态名、类型信息、序列化器与原作业一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"故障恢复-恢复时间是状态大小-并行度与本地性的乘积\">故障恢复：恢复时间是状态大小、并行度与本地性的乘积</h2><p>故障恢复的流程很直白：JobManager 从最近一次<strong>已完成</strong>的 checkpoint（或 savepoint）读取状态分片，分发给替换的 TaskManager，各算子从快照记录的 offset 重新消费上游。<strong>没有可重放的数据源，一切免谈</strong>——这也是为什么 <a href=\"checkpoint-barrier-exactly-once\"><code>2_checkpoint-barrier-exactly-once.md</code></a> 里的 barrier 与两阶段提交跟本文同一条链：快照给切点，恢复给回到切点的路径。恢复耗时大致是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>recover</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>state</mtext></msub><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>rescale</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>catchup</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{recover}} \\approx \\frac{S_{\\text{state}}}{B_{\\text{net}}} + T_{\\text{rescale}} + T_{\\text{catchup}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recover</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">state</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rescale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">catchup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>state</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{state}}/B_{\\text{net}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">state</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是从远端拉状态的时间，随状态规模线性增长——这解释了「大状态意味着长恢复时间」；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>rescale</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{rescale}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rescale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是调度与状态重分布；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>catchup</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{catchup}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">catchup</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是重放停机期间积压的数据。可调项有三：</p>\n<p><strong>任务本地恢复。</strong> 把 checkpoint 的一份副本留在 TaskManager 本地磁盘，恢复时优先读本地、不经网络，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>state</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>net</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{\\text{state}}/B_{\\text{net}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">state</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">net</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 几乎压掉。默认关闭，需显式打开。用增量 RocksDB 快照时，本地副本复用 RocksDB 原生 checkpoint 目录与硬链接，几乎不产生额外写入——但<strong>本地目录与 RocksDB 目录必须同物理设备</strong>。TaskManager 一旦丢失，本地副本作废，恢复回退到分布式存储。它只覆盖 keyed 状态，而那恰恰是最大的一块。</p>\n<p><strong>增量快照与 changelog。</strong> RocksDB 增量快照只记录相对上一次已完成 checkpoint 的变更，通过 compaction 自动合并历史，能显著缩短 checkpoint 时长。代价是恢复时可能要拉更多增量分片——瓶颈在网络带宽时恢复反而更慢，瓶颈在 CPU/IOPS 时更快。开启后 Web UI 的 <code>Checkpointed Data Size</code> 只显示增量，容易被误读。更进一步是 <strong>changelog</strong>（<code>state.changelog.enabled: true</code>，落 <code>state.changelog.storage: filesystem</code>）：状态变更持续上传，checkpoint 本身变得极轻，代价是额外文件、IO、CPU 与缓冲内存；它要求 <code>max-concurrent-checkpoints: 1</code>，不支持 <code>NO_CLAIM</code> 恢复，ForSt 也不支持。</p>\n<p><strong>自适应调度。</strong> 资源不足（包括 TaskManager 掉线）时，自适应调度器按可用 slot 下调并行度并自动重缩放，而不是让作业失败；资源回来后再扩回去。它用「声明资源」替代「申请固定 slot 数」，重缩放基于最新 savepoint 自动完成。代价是<strong>不支持部分失败恢复</strong>：任何故障都重启整个作业，而默认调度器可只重启受影响的 region。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>状态后端 = <strong>本地形态</strong>（<code>state.backend.type</code>）+ <strong>快照落点</strong>（<code>execution.checkpointing.storage/dir</code>）两个独立决策。</li>\n<li>硬门槛是状态能否装进内存：装得下用 <code>hashmap</code> 换极致吞吐，装不下用 <code>rocksdb</code>，本地盘也扛不住时看实验性的 <code>forst</code>（无 canonical savepoint）。RocksDB 的两个隐性成本：key/value 上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>31</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{31}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">31</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 字节而 merge 类状态会静默突破；定时器默认也存 RocksDB，切成 heap 会失去异步快照。</li>\n<li>迁移的核心是 <strong>operator UID 到状态的行映射</strong>；<strong>换后端只能用 canonical savepoint</strong>，换并行度受 <code>maxParallelism</code> 一锤定音，超出常规迁移用 State Processor API。</li>\n<li>恢复时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span></span></span></span></span> 拉状态 / 带宽 + 重缩放 + 追积压；手段有任务本地恢复、增量快照/changelog、自适应调度，各有边界。</li>\n<li>投产前核对：单 TM 状态 / 堆占比 &lt; 50%、<code>maxParallelism</code> 预留到未来 2 倍并行度、大状态作业开启任务本地恢复、checkpoint 实测时长显著小于间隔、savepoint 为 canonical 且算子 UID 全覆盖。</li>\n<li>与本章前两篇连读：状态模型见 <a href=\"keyed-operator-state-ttl-model\"><code>1_keyed-operator-state-ttl-model.md</code></a>，快照与 exactly-once 语义见 <a href=\"checkpoint-barrier-exactly-once\"><code>2_checkpoint-barrier-exactly-once.md</code></a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"参考来源\">参考来源</h2><p>核验自 Apache Flink 文档 1.20/2.0（nightlies.apache.org）的 <em>State Backends</em>、<em>Savepoints</em>、<em>State Processor API</em>、<em>Tuning Checkpoints and Large State</em>、<em>Memory Tuning</em>、<em>Elastic Scaling</em>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"状态后端选型、状态迁移与故障恢复","id":"状态后端选型-状态迁移与故障恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：状态后端是「本地形态」与「快照形态」的组合","id":"核心概念-状态后端是-本地形态-与-快照形态-的组合"},{"level":2,"text":"选型：先估算状态规模，再决定要不要过序列化边界","id":"选型-先估算状态规模-再决定要不要过序列化边界"},{"level":2,"text":"状态迁移：savepoint 是 operator UID 到状态的映射","id":"状态迁移-savepoint-是-operator-uid-到状态的映射"},{"level":2,"text":"故障恢复：恢复时间是状态大小、并行度与本地性的乘积","id":"故障恢复-恢复时间是状态大小-并行度与本地性的乘积"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"参考来源","id":"参考来源"}],"prev":{"title":"Checkpoint 快照、Barrier 对齐与 Exactly-Once 保证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/streaming-sql-materialized-view-engine-flink/state-backend-fault-tolerance/checkpoint-barrier-exactly-once"},"next":{"title":"流 SQL 优化器：谓词下推、Join 重排与有状态优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/streaming-sql-materialized-view-engine-flink/operations-optimization-engines/planner-pushdown-stateful-optimization"}}